.TH dumphf "1" "" "The scalpel3 Headers/Footers Dumper" "The scalpel3 Headers/Footers Dumper"

.SH NAME
dumphf \- Dump the content of a scalpel3 headers/footers database

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dumphf
[header_footer_database_pathname]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBdumphf\fR deserializes and displays the contents of a scalpel3 headers/footers database file. This database is typically generated by the \fBscalpel3\fR tool with the \fB-H\fR option.

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
.TP
.I [header_footer_database_pathname]
Optional. The path to the headers/footers database file. If not specified, it defaults to "scalpel-output/headersfooters.dat".

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scalpel3 (1)

.SH AUTHOR
Golden G. Richard III.
